if(A.dK(g,A.a(["blood test","lab","results","hormone test"],k)))return"A lab is a snapshot with a range, a date, and a reason. The words on the report are written for clinicians, so EVA translates the name and leaves the verdict alone.\n\nName the marker \u2014 ferritin, TSH, estradiol, progesterone, AMH \u2014 and the cycle day if you know it. The note explains what the test is trying to see. This reply will not tell you that you are normal, sick, fertile, or infertile."
