B.GO=new A.eh("seed-1","Pregnancy","Harbor Wren","Week 20 and I finally felt a flutter that was not digestion. I wrote the time down instead of trying to make it mean everything.",!1,!1,B.D)
B.GU=new A.eh("seed-2","Fertility","Kind Moss","The fertile window is a maybe, not a scoreboard. Saying that out loud made this month less cruel.",!0,!1,B.D)
B.GP=new A.eh("seed-3","PCOS","Still River","My cycles are 35 to 60 days. A perfect 28-day chart used to make me feel behind. Symptom notes have been more honest.",!1,!1,B.D)
